// ==========================================
// 02: EUCLIDEAN RHYTHMS & POLYRHYTHMS
// ==========================================
// Euclidean rhythms distribute N pulses as evenly as possible over M steps.
// Syntax: sound(hits, steps)

// 1. Classic Afro-Cuban Tresillo (3 hits over 8 steps):
s("bd(3,8)")

// 2. Add an offbeat hi-hat (5 hits over 8 steps) with stack():
